            The intuitive reasoning is the same as before, only that now we don’t fix a single point. For more details and in particular for descriptions and examples of how to explicitly compute these loops space objects by
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+limits"} homotopy limits
            see the examples listed at
          %ul
            %li
